cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite the paper below (preferred-citation) and, for the code, this repository."
title: "Ternary NCM: code and results for ternary (BitNet b1.58) quantization of Next-Concept Models"
abstract: >-
  Code, logs and verified results for ternary (BitNet b1.58-style) quantization of the official
  Next-Concept Modeling (NCM) Sudoku-hard checkpoint: post-training ternarization collapses to 0% solved,
  while quantization-aware fine-tuning recovers 71.15 ± 0.40% (82.6% of full precision).
